 "headline": "White Mambas Are Running Up The Score",
 "notes": [
  "theInfamous took 3PTM and DREB back from Da Don Da Beard & Da Klaw, and Kevin Huerter shot 1-8 for the privilege of making it close.",
  "White Mambas have Bam Adebayo at 24-15-12 on 8-11 shooting, and Jamal Murray and Josh Giddey are still stacking numbers beside him.",
  "LeParth James grabbed FG% from White Mambas despite Derrick White's 0-3 shooting, because Anthony Davis dragged 22 points out of 8-13 on his own.",
  "Zero Fox Given snatched 3PT% from Nova Knicks while DeMar DeRozan shot 1-5, and Mikal Bridges is 0-6 for the other side.",
  "BrookynDynasty has Nikola Joki\u0107 at 30 points and 14 boards on 12-16 shooting, and still trails Thug Life 5-6. Impressive way to waste a monster night."
 ],
